  "goodToKnow": "Der Hungerstreik is a hunger strike: in den Hungerstreik treten, einen Hungerstreik beenden. Imprisoned RAF members used hunger strikes in the 1970s and 80s, and Holger Meins died during one in 1974. In 2021, young climate activists held one in Berlin before the federal election. Der Streik means strike, and streiken to strike. Plural: die Hungerstreiks."
